<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss palladium/platinum export data for April.</title>
<headline>Swiss palladium/platinum export data for April.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss exports of raw or powdered palladium stood at 4,312 kg in April, bringing the cumulative total for 1997 to 37,195 kg, the Federal Customs Office said.</p>
<p>		     April 1997	  Jan-April 1997</p>
<p> Exports	    4,312		   37,195</p>
<p> Imports	    1,494		    2,818</p>
<p>The biggest receiver of Swiss palladium exports in April was Japan, with 2,412 kg. The biggest source of imports was the United States, with 811 kg.</p>
<p>Platinum:</p>
<p>		     April 1997	  Jan-April 1997</p>
<p> Exports	    4,888		   14,099</p>
<p> Imports	    2,444		    6,406</p>
<p>The biggest receiver of Swiss platinum exports in April was the United States, with 1,816 kg. The biggest source of imports was South Africa, with 1,722 kg.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
